<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Blog - Peak Interval</title>
    
    <!-- SEO Meta Tags -->
    <meta name="description" content="Read the latest articles about interval training, workout tips, and Peak Interval app updates.">
    <meta name="robots" content="index, follow">
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://www.peakintervalapp.com/blog">

    <!-- Favicon -->
    <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/favicon.ico">

    <!-- Open Graph Meta Tags -->
    <meta property="og:title" content="Blog - Peak Interval">
    <meta property="og:description" content="Read the latest articles about interval training, workout tips, and Peak Interval app updates.">
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://www.peakintervalapp.com/assets/app_icon.png">
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://www.peakintervalapp.com/blog">
    <meta property="og:type" content="website">

    <!-- Twitter Card Meta Tags -->
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
    <meta name="twitter:title" content="Blog - Peak Interval">
    <meta name="twitter:description" content="Read the latest articles about interval training, workout tips, and Peak Interval app updates.">
    <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://www.peakintervalapp.com/assets/app_icon.png">

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
            background: #181F3B;
            color: white;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 0;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }
        
        .header {
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            background-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }
        
        .logo {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 15px;
        }
        
        .app-icon {
            width: 60px;
            height: 60px;
            border-radius: 15px;
        }
        
        .logo-text {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        
        .nav {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 30px;
            padding: 15px 0;
            background-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }
        
        .nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
            opacity: 0.8;
            transition: opacity 0.2s;
        }
        
        .nav a:hover {
            opacity: 1;
        }
        
        .nav a.active {
            opacity: 1;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #FF9500;
        }
        
        .blog-header {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 60px 20px 40px;
        }
        
        .blog-title {
            font-size: 42px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        
        .blog-description {
            font-size: 20px;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto 40px;
            line-height: 1.5;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }
        
        .blog-content {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 20px 60px;
        }
        
        .category-cards {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(1, 1fr);
            gap: 20px;
        }
        
        @media (min-width: 576px) {
            .category-cards {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
        }
        
        @media (min-width: 992px) {
            .category-cards {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            }
        }
        
        .category-card {
            position: relative;
            height: 200px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            overflow: hidden;
            background-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }
        
        .category-link {
            display: block;
            height: 100%;
            width: 100%;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: white;
        }
        
        .category-image {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
        }
        
        .category-label {
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            padding: 14px 16px;
            background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0.75), rgba(0,0,0,0));
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .category-label .count {
            display: block;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 400;
            opacity: 0.8;
        }

        .latest-posts {
            margin-top: 60px;
        }

        .latest-posts h2 {
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .latest-posts ul {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 0;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(1, 1fr);
            gap: 10px;
        }

        @media (min-width: 768px) {
            .latest-posts ul {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
        }

        .latest-posts a {
            color: #fff;
            text-decoration: none;
            opacity: 0.9;
            line-height: 1.4;
            display: block;
        }

        .latest-posts a:hover {
            opacity: 1;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .all-articles {
            margin-top: 60px;
        }

        .all-articles h2 {
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .all-articles .intro {
            opacity: 0.75;
            margin: 0 0 30px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .all-articles h3 {
            font-size: 18px;
            margin: 32px 0 12px;
            padding-bottom: 8px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
        }

        .all-articles h3 a {
            color: #FF9500;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .all-articles h3 a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .all-articles ul {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 0;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(1, 1fr);
            gap: 10px;
        }

        @media (min-width: 768px) {
            .all-articles ul {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
        }

        .all-articles a {
            color: #fff;
            text-decoration: none;
            opacity: 0.9;
            line-height: 1.4;
            display: block;
        }

        .all-articles a:hover {
            opacity: 1;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .placeholder {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
        }
        
        .footer {
            padding: 40px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .footer-links {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        
        .footer-links a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            opacity: 0.7;
            transition: opacity 0.2s;
        }
        
        .footer-links a:hover {
            opacity: 1;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        
        .copyright {
            opacity: 0.7;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <div class="logo">
            <a href="/">
                <img src="/assets/app_icon.png" alt="Peak Interval App Icon" class="app-icon">
            </a>
            <div class="logo-text">Peak Interval</div>
        </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="nav">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <a href="/blog" class="active">Blog</a>
        <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
    </div>
    
    <div class="blog-header">
        <h1 class="blog-title">Explore</h1>
        <p class="blog-description">
            Discover tips, techniques, and insights to maximize your interval training workouts and get the most out of the Peak Interval app.
        </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="blog-content">
        <div class="category-cards">
            {%- assign allPosts = collections.posts -%}
            {%- for categoryPage in collections.categoryPages -%}
                {%- assign slug = categoryPage.slug -%}
                {%- case slug -%}
                    {%- when 'workout-guides' -%}{%- assign image = '/assets/blog/workouts-programs-category.jpg' -%}
                    {%- when 'specialized-hiit-training' -%}{%- assign image = '/assets/blog/specialized-training-category.jpg' -%}
                    {%- when 'hiit-fundamentals' -%}{%- assign image = '/assets/blog/hiit-fundamentals-category.jpg' -%}
                    {%- when 'fitness-nutrition' -%}{%- assign image = '/assets/blog/fitness-nutrition-category.jpg' -%}
                    {%- when 'hiit-success-stories' -%}{%- assign image = '/assets/blog/hiit-success-stories-category.jpg' -%}
                    {%- when 'advanced-hiit-concepts' -%}{%- assign image = '/assets/blog/advanced-hiit-concepts-category.jpg' -%}
                    {%- when 'app-features' -%}{%- assign image = '/assets/blog/app-features-category.jpg' -%}
                    {%- else -%}{%- assign image = '' -%}
                {%- endcase -%}
                {%- assign postCount = 0 -%}
                {%- for post in allPosts -%}
                    {%- if post.data.category == categoryPage.category -%}{%- assign postCount = postCount | plus: 1 -%}{%- endif -%}
                {%- endfor -%}
            <div class="category-card">
                <a href="/blog/{{ slug }}" class="category-link">
                    {% if image != '' %}
                    <img src="{{ image }}" alt="{{ categoryPage.category }}" class="category-image">
                    {% else %}
                    <div class="placeholder"></div>
                    {% endif %}
                    <span class="category-label">
                        {{ categoryPage.category }}
                        <span class="count">{{ postCount }} article{% if postCount != 1 %}s{% endif %}</span>
                    </span>
                </a>
            </div>
            {%- endfor -%}
        </div>

        <div class="latest-posts">
            <h2>Latest articles</h2>
            <ul>
                {%- assign recentPosts = collections.posts | reverse -%}
                {%- for post in recentPosts limit: 12 -%}
                <li>
                    <a href="{{ post.url | stripTrailingSlash }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
                </li>
                {%- endfor -%}
            </ul>
        </div>

        {%- comment -%}
          Every post is listed here, not just the recent ones. The category hubs
          already link their own posts, but that puts each post three clicks from
          the homepage and behind a hub Google rarely recrawls. Listing the full
          archive here makes every post reachable in two clicks from the most
          frequently crawled pages on the site.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <div class="all-articles">
            <h2>All articles</h2>
            <p class="intro">Every article on the Peak Interval blog, grouped by topic.</p>
            {%- for categoryPage in collections.categoryPages -%}
                {%- assign categoryPosts = allPosts | where: "data.category", categoryPage.category -%}
                {%- if categoryPosts.size > 0 -%}
            <h3><a href="/blog/{{ categoryPage.slug }}">{{ categoryPage.category }}</a></h3>
            <ul>
                {%- for post in categoryPosts -%}
                <li>
                    <a href="{{ post.url | stripTrailingSlash }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
                </li>
                {%- endfor -%}
            </ul>
                {%- endif -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="footer">
        <div class="footer-links">
            <a href="/">Home</a>
            <a href="/terms">Terms & Conditions</a>
            <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
            <a href="/contact">Contact Us</a>
            <a href="/blog">Blog</a>
        </div>
        <div class="copyright">
            &copy; 2023-2024 Peak Interval. All rights reserved.
        </div>
    </div>

